Z||000001||mrfixit58||09-25-2001||08:17 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by hutch84fierose:<BR><B>I am thinking about put a spoiler on my car but I was thinking of something thats interesting.  I don't want the original stock look something new maybe a little bigger ...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Anything bigger than then a stock wing will have to come from the airport!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Roy  :D <BR>Just another stock Blue 87 GT   <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pennocksize.JPG">    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/halfpole.gif"> ||||reg||12
