Z||000003||Philphine||09-25-2001||10:19 AM||||coupe or gt? <P> ok just paid attention to your name (i'm highly observant  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"> ).<P> i have late 80's mustang wings on two coupes. a saleen and an f-40. both match the body lines pretty good (kind of squared off). for me the saleen looks about as good as a stock wing and makes a good alternative wing if you have two coupes and want to give one a different look or just want something different.<P> if you going for rediculous (and i was. i put it on my chopper so it's even more so) look at an f-40. it's about 16" high with louvers in the sides. makes my fiero look like an updated mini superbird.<p>[This message has been edited by Philphine (edited 09-25-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000004||deceler8||09-25-2001||10:56 AM||||I've seen Dodge Shadow spoilers on Fieros and they look pretty good.<P>And a pretty good fit as well.||||reg||1
